li-for = link in linklists['occasions'].links
```
- `link.object.title` &mdash; the linked resource's title
- `link.object.description` &mdash; the linked collection's description (**only valid if linklist links point to collections**)
- `li-block="Services CTA"` / `li-block="Occasions CTA"` &mdash; unique block names per section
**Team section &mdash; static URLs:**
```
li-object:href = pages['about-us'].url     &larr; bracket notation required for hyphenated handles
li-object:href = routes.contact_url
```
 
