## Personalization Upcharge (Product Page &rarr; Cart)

**Option A implemented** (per `docs/collections-architecture.md`): a separate "Monogramming Service" product/variant gets added to the cart alongside the main item, as its own line, when the customer opts into personalization.

### How it works
- `_sections/Product Hero.html` has a section setting **"Monogramming Service Variant ID"** (`li-settings:number`) &mdash; merchant enters the numeric variant ID of the Monogramming Service product here, per section instance (i.e. can differ per product if needed, though normally one variant covers all products).
- On click of the Add to Cart button, a small script (separate from and non-interfering with Liquiflow's native `handleVariant` add-to-cart flow) checks whether the personalization checkbox is checked. If so, it fires an independent `POST /cart/add.js` for the configured service variant, carrying the same `properties[...]` (Monogram Style, Text Color, Placement, Monogram Text) as the main item.
- The displayed price next to the checkbox now reads `product.metafields.custom.personalization_cost | money` (per-product, dynamic) instead of a hardcoded "$15".

### Merchant setup required before this works
1. &#9989; **"Monogramming Service"** product created on production (2026-07-23) &mdash; `gid://shopify/Product/10144255508729`, status `DRAFT` (intentionally invisible on the current live spirit-wear storefront). **Price still $0.00 &mdash; needs the real personalization upcharge amount set before launch**, no figure was available at creation time.
2. &#9989; Variant ID: **`48705471414521`** &mdash; enter this into Product Hero's "Monogramming Service Variant ID" setting.
3. &#11036; In the Theme Editor, open the Product Hero section settings and enter `48705471414521` into **"Monogramming Service Variant ID"** &mdash; not yet done, theme isn't pushed to production yet.
4. &#11036; Keep `product.metafields.custom.personalization_cost` in sync with that product's actual price per product &mdash; the displayed price and the charged price are two separate places right now (no Shopify Function enforcing they match, per the "no Shopify Plus required" constraint). Also flip the product to `ACTIVE` + publish to Online Store before this feature needs to work for real customers.

Also created 2026-07-23 (production, `custom` namespace, pinned): `monogramming_enabled` (boolean), `personalization_cost` (money), `delivery_time` (single line text). **Not yet created**: `monogram_styles`, `monogram_text_colors`, `monogram_placement` &mdash; all three are `list.metaobject_reference` fields and need their target metaobject definitions (`monogram_style`, `text_color`, `monogram_position`) created first.

